  "description": "<p data-end=\"463\" data-start=\"114\">Brillay represents accessible elegance and contemporary design. Our brand was created to offer jewelry that catches the eye and enhances every outfit, without compromising on style or affordability. With a sophisticated and modern aesthetic, Brillay celebrates beauty in every detail, making every day a special occasion.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"861\" data-start=\"465\"><strong data-end=\"489\" data-start=\"465\">Product Description:</strong><br data-end=\"492\" data-start=\"489\">Brillay jewelry is crafted with high-quality materials and meticulous attention to detail. Each piece is designed to highlight the femininity and personality of the wearer, ranging from minimalist lines to bold statement designs. Our collections include rings, bracelets, necklaces, and earrings, all focused on stylish and versatile designs perfect for any occasion.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"896\" data-start=\"863\"><strong data-end=\"894\" data-start=\"863\">USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1205\" data-start=\"897\">\r\n<li data-end=\"988\" data-start=\"897\"><strong data-end=\"920\" data-start=\"899\">Exclusive Design:</strong> Trend-inspired pieces that offer a sophisticated and modern look.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1093\" data-start=\"989\"><strong data-end=\"1013\" data-start=\"991\">Affordable Luxury:</strong> High-end aesthetics at competitive prices, making style an everyday pleasure.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1205\" data-start=\"1094\"><strong data-end=\"1112\" data-start=\"1096\">Versatility:</strong> Jewelry that seamlessly transitions from casual to elegant, adapting to your unique style.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-end=\"1309\" data-start=\"1207\"><strong data-end=\"1225\" data-start=\"1207\">Payment Terms:</strong><br data-end=\"1228\" data-start=\"1225\">Brillay offers a variety of payment options for maximum convenience, including:</p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1452\" data-start=\"1310\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1373\" data-start=\"1310\">Credit and debit cards (Visa, Mastercard, American Express)</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1407\" data-start=\"1374\">PayPal, Google Pay, Apple Pay</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1452\" data-start=\"1408\">Klarna for flexible installment payments</li>\r\n</ul>",
